      "mergedPostDetails": "Friends Favorites lists specifically has not been updating itself, stopping in place shortly after login and doesn't update again until I restart the game.  It has its good days and bad days, today it didn't update so much as once after I got on, and I restarted the game several times with the same results each time. There's other days where it'll work for a few hours before it stops, but it rarely works indefinitely for some reason.  This is in addition/separate from the friends list bug in general since often times (such as today) the overall friends list works fine even when favorites do not.",
