      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: Right now a sort of similar issue is going on where outdated information is showing for some people in the social menu that doesn't get updated until you view their profile in the main menu.\n\nFor instance, I had one friend the other night that was showing up as orange in the quick menu friend's wing, but when I brought them up in the main menu, their status *immediately* changed to green and showed them as being in an open lobby. This happens with multiple friends.",
