      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found that there are two different variations of this bug. One is more common, where socials (players' locations, status, and thumbnail) continue updating but at an irregular rate, and sometimes only updating individual players when triggered manually by clicking through to their page.\n\nThe other is more severe, where at some point socials will stop updating entirely and invites are no longer received in game. Socials and invites remain broken until restarting the game, which also requires logging in again. In this case it is related to this IPv6 issue and can be worked around with some of the solutions discussed here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/restart-to-receive-invites",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
