      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "601acb21f76d3163c5e74920",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems that the post has not been updated quite often, but as of April 2025, I am experiencing this issue in my environment too. The Social is not updating at all and remains as it was when I logged in. Even when I confirm my friends' online status on the VRC web, they still appear as \"offline\" in Social. When I open that friend's bio from Social, it does show the correct status, however this friend will disappear from my friend list until I restart the game.\n\nYes, I've read and checked with the IPv6 thing.. but I cant do anything with it because I am on Pico4 android, and no such settings.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6842cae5007db83cc10ff89c",
